WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.754
Namaste. Is video mein restaurant ke naye kaam dekhenge.

00:00:03.754 --> 00:00:08.917
Har dish ki recipe, yaani ek plate mein kitna paneer, kitna tel, kitna pyaaz.

00:00:08.917 --> 00:00:11.598
Usse har plate ka kharcha aur food cost.

00:00:11.598 --> 00:00:18.571
Aur jab dish bikti hai, to kaccha maal stock se apne aap kam hota hai. Ye restaurant ka public demo hai.

00:00:18.912 --> 00:00:25.745
Restaurant mein Recipes and food cost. Upar kitni dishes ki recipe bani hai aur average food cost.

00:00:25.745 --> 00:00:29.790
Har dish ke saath uska plate cost aur food cost pratishat.

00:00:29.790 --> 00:00:34.043
Jis dish ka food cost zyada hai, wo alag tab mein dikhti hai.

00:00:34.492 --> 00:00:41.931
No recipe yet tab mein wo dishes hain jinki recipe abhi nahi bani. Dal Makhani kholte hain.

00:00:41.931 --> 00:00:46.263
Upar likha hai ye kitne mein bikti hai, GST se pehle.

00:00:46.622 --> 00:00:50.265
Urad dal abhi kaccha maal list mein nahi hai.

00:00:50.265 --> 00:00:59.897
New raw material: naam Urad dal, kilo mein, ek sau chaalis rupaye kilo, stock das kilo, aur do kilo se kam ho to alert.

00:00:59.897 --> 00:01:01.273
Add raw material.

00:01:01.631 --> 00:01:08.663
Ek plate mein kitna jaata hai. Urad dal assi gram. Butter bees gram aur cream tees ml, list se.

00:01:08.663 --> 00:01:12.882
Kilo wale maal gram mein, litre wale ml mein likhte hain.

00:01:13.262 --> 00:01:21.134
Neeche turant hisaab: ek plate ka kharcha, food cost pratishat, aur ek plate par kitna bachta hai.

00:01:21.134 --> 00:01:25.953
Save recipe. Ab har bikti plate ye maal stock se kam karegi.

00:01:26.332 --> 00:01:34.023
Ab ek table ka order. Khaali table kholte hain, Skip, aur do Dal Makhani aur ek Paneer Tikka.

00:01:40.029 --> 00:01:49.160
K O T se kitchen ko bheja. Khana ho gaya, Settle, Take payment, aur Confirm settlement. Table khaali.

00:01:51.423 --> 00:01:59.005
Kitchen stock. Har kaccha maal kitna bacha, pichhle dino mein kitna laga, aur kitne din chalega.

00:01:59.005 --> 00:02:06.903
Urad dal das kilo se ab nau kilo aath sau chaalis gram, kyunki do plate mein ek sau saath gram gayi.

00:02:06.903 --> 00:02:09.194
Jo kam hai wo Low dikhta hai.

00:02:09.813 --> 00:02:16.449
Kabhi maal kharab hota hai, ya staff khaana khaata hai. Wastage or staff meal.

00:02:16.449 --> 00:02:23.510
Wastage, doodh, do litre, yaani do hazaar ml, kyun: raat bhar bahar reh gaya. Save.

00:02:23.510 --> 00:02:28.104
Ye bhi stock se kam hota hai aur alag likha rehta hai.

00:02:28.467 --> 00:02:33.069
Kaccha maal khareedne par Record a purchase se purchase bill daalo.

00:02:33.069 --> 00:02:38.838
Stock badhta hai, aur naya kharid daam recipe ke kharche mein apne aap aa jaata hai.

00:02:39.209 --> 00:02:44.791
Aur Profit report mein har dish ka munafa ab recipe ke asli kharche se banta hai.

00:02:44.791 --> 00:02:50.580
Kaunsi dish sabse zyada kama rahi hai, aur kaunsi mein daam badhane ki zaroorat hai.

00:02:51.057 --> 00:03:05.036
To restaurant ke liye: har dish ki recipe, plate ka kharcha aur food cost, bikte hi kaccha maal apne aap kam, wastage ka record, aur dish-wise asli munafa.

00:03:05.036 --> 00:03:06.028
Dhanyavaad.
